<title>UK: British Aerospace jumps ahead of air show.</title>
<headline>British Aerospace jumps ahead of air show.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British Aerospace jumped to a record high ahead of the Farnborough air show.</p>
<p>The show, held just outside London, begins on Monday. In the past, companies have used the Farnborough air show as a forum to deliver good news to the public.</p>
<p>By 0848 GMT, the shares were quoted at 1013-1/2, up 17p, after reaching a peak at 1015p.</p>
<p>Traders noted several large buy orders, and said the advance above 1000p, seen as a technical barrier, sparked more buying and squeezed shorts out of the market.</p>
<p>--Debra Sherman, London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
